{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27160","headline":"送人赴举 · 郑巢","name":"送人赴举","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"篇章动玉京，坠叶满前程。\n旧国与僧别，秋江罢钓行。\n马过隋代寺，樯出楚山城。\n应近嵩阳宿，潜闻瀑布声。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"郑巢","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_27160.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27160","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}